    change, and value between 0 and 1 will decrease damage received, being 1 equal
    to total resistance, receiving 0 damage.


    Between -10 and 0, it will be weakness, adding to the basedamage, the damage resistance
    value multiplied for the damage value, with a maximum of damage equal to damage
    + damagex10.'
  receiveDamageFromCollisionsEnabled: 0
  minTimeToReceiveDamageOnImpact: 0
  minVelocityToReceiveDamageOnImpact: 0
  receiveDamageOnImpactMultiplier: 0
  addDamageReceiversToCustomTransformList: 0
  customTransformListDamageReceiver: []
